1. Objective
Build a web application that allows an administrator to manage employee records through a simple and
intuitive user interface. The application must support complete CRUD operations using a frontend, REST APIs,
and a database.

2. Functional requirements
A. Employee management
Each employee record must contain: Employee ID, Full Name, Email Address, Phone Number, Department,
Designation, Date of Joining, Salary, and Employment Status (Active or Inactive).
• Add a new employee; view employee details; edit employee information.
• Delete an employee with confirmation; list all employees.
• Search employees by name or email.
• Filter by department and employment status.
• Implement pagination for the employee list.
B. User interface
• Responsive Employee List page.
• Add Employee page/form.
• Edit Employee page/form.
• Employee Details page.
C. Backend
Implement REST APIs to support the required employee management operations and integrate them with the
frontend and persistent storage.